sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Enrollment API
    participant DB as enrollment schema (PostgreSQL)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    Note over API,DB: ONE local transaction — all or nothing
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: pg_advisory_xact_lock(offering id) — seat lock
    Note right of DB: concurrent enrollments for the same<br/>offering now queue here, one at a time
    API->>DB: SELECT existing enrollment (student, offering)
    alt already enrolled / waitlisted
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK → 409 ALREADY_ENROLLED
    end
    API->>DB: COUNT enrolled for offering
    alt full and no waitlist wanted
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK → 409 COURSE_FULL
    end
    API->>DB: INSERT course_enrollments (ENROLLED or WAITLISTED)
    API->>DB: INSERT registration_log (COURSE_ENROLL / COURSE_WAITLIST)
    API->>DB: COMMIT — lock released
    API-)MQ: publish enrollment.student-enrolled (only after commit)
